# Frontend conventions

## Type sources

- Project types come from [@slop/schemas](../../packages/schemas/) — the package re-exports namespaces `timeline_v1`, `timeline_v2`, `ops_v1`, `plan_v1`, plus the v1 types at top level for ergonomics.
- Never re-declare schema types by hand. If you need a narrower view (e.g. `TrackItem`), derive it from `SlopTimeline["tracks"][number]["items"][number]`.
- Generated files at [packages/schemas/generated/](../../packages/schemas/generated/) are produced by `pnpm --filter @slop/schemas codegen`. They are gitignored and regenerated by CI; do not hand-edit.

## Linting and types

- `tsconfig.json` is `strict: true` everywhere. Do not weaken it locally.
- `eslint --max-warnings 0` is a hard CI gate. No `any`. No `// @ts-ignore` without a `// reason: ...` comment on the line above.
- Use functional components and React 18 hooks. No class components.
- State: Zustand + Immer for global UI state ([apps/desktop/src/store.ts](../../apps/desktop/src/store.ts)). React `useState` for component-local state.

## Styling

- CSS variables defined in [apps/desktop/src/index.css](../../apps/desktop/src/index.css). Use `var(--accent)`, `var(--bg-1)`, etc. Do not hardcode colors.
- No CSS-in-JS framework. Inline styles or component-scoped CSS only.

## i18n

- Strings shown to users go through `react-i18next`'s `useTranslation` and live in [apps/desktop/src/i18n/locales/](../../apps/desktop/src/i18n/locales/). Five locales today: en, de, es, fr, ja. Do not ship English-only strings into release builds.

## Test strategy

- Unit tests for pure logic (reducer-shaped store actions, parsers): Vitest, in `__tests__/` next to the code.
- IPC mocks: `vi.mock("../ipc", ...)` per [apps/desktop/src/__tests__/store.test.ts](../../apps/desktop/src/__tests__/store.test.ts).
- Integration tests against a live web server (Playwright + axe-core): in `[scripts/a11y-audit.mjs](../../scripts/a11y-audit.mjs)` and the `integration-a11y` CI job.
